    10</span><!----> <!--[--><!--$s4--><!--[-1--><!----><div data-scope="slider" data-part="root" data-orientation="horizontal" id="slider:s4" dir="ltr" style="--slider-thumb-offset-0:calc(64.28571428571429% - 0px);--slider-thumb-transform:translateX(-50%);--slider-range-start:0%;--slider-range-end:35.71428571428571%;" class="relative flex w-full touch-none select-none items-center overflow-hidden h-8"><!--[--><!--[-1--><!----><div data-scope="slider" data-part="control" dir="ltr" id="slider:s4:control" data-orientation="horizontal" style="touch-action:none;user-select:none;webkit-user-select:none;position:relative;" class="w-full relative flex items-center"><!--[--><!--[-1--><!----><div data-scope="slider" data-part="track" dir="ltr" id="slider:s4:track" data-orientation="horizontal" style="position:relative;" class="bg-white relative h-1 w-full grow cursor-pointer rounded-full"><!--[--><!--[-1--><!----><div id="slider:s4:range" data-scope="slider" data-part="range" dir="ltr" data-orientation="horizontal" style="position:absolute;left:var(--slider-range-start);right:var(--slider-range-end);" class="bg-gi-cryo text-section-body absolute h-full rounded-full"><!----><!----></div><!----><!--]--><!--]--><!----><!----></div><!----><!--]--><!--]--> <!--[--><!--[-1--><!----><div data-scope="slider" data-part="thumb" dir="ltr" data-index="0" id="slider:s4:thumb:0" data-orientation="horizontal" draggable="false" aria-labelledby="slider:s4:label" aria-orientation="horizontal" aria-valuemax="15" aria-valuemin="1" aria-valuenow="10" role="slider" tabindex="0" style="visibility:hidden;position:absolute;transform:var(--slider-thumb-transform);inset-inline-start:var(--slider-thumb-offset-0);" class="bg-white size-5 border-3 sm:size-3.5 rounded-full sm:border-2 border-gi-cryo outline-none ring-0 cursor-pointer"><!--[--><!--[2--><!----><input type="text" hidden="" value="10" id="slider:s4:input:0"><!----><!--]--><!--]--><!----><!----></div><!----><!--]--><!----><!--]--><!----><!----></div><!----><!--]--><!--]--><!----><!----></div><!----><!--]--><!--]--></div><!----></div><!--]--></h3></div><!--]--> <!--[0--><div class="p-2.5 pt-0 flex flex-col gap-5"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 xl:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(22rem,0.95fr)] gap-2.5 items-stretch min-w-0"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4 text-sm leading-4 min-w-0"><div class="text-sm"><p class="leading-6"><!--[0--><span class="gb-wrap-text text-sm leading-6 min-w-0 wrap-break-word"><!--[0--><!---->素早いステップを踏んで複数回の<span style="color: #99FFFF;">氷元素範囲ダメージ</span>を与え、自身の<a href="#talent-11502-tooltip-11500001" data-link-token="N11500001" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity"><span style="color: #FFD780;">独舞者のシルエット</span></a>を召喚し、<span style="color: #FFD780;">雪鳥の夢</span>効果を獲得する。雪鳥の夢：オデットが与える星反応ダメージをアップする。<br/>また、元素爆発<span style="color: #FFD780;">疾きブルーバードの夢</span>を発動した後の6秒間、オデットの元素スキル<span style="color: #FFD780;">柔きファントムの夜の舞</span>は、特別な元素スキル<a href="#talent-11502-tooltip-11500002" data-link-token="N11500002" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity"><span style="color: #FFD780;">柔き払暁のコーダ</span></a><a href="#talent-11502-tooltip-11500004" data-link-token="N11500004" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity"></a>に変わる。<br/><br/>すでにフィールド上にオデット自身が作り出した独舞者のシルエットが存在する場合、自身の傍に再生成し、継続時間をリセットする。<!----><!--]--></span> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!--]--><!----></p></div></div> <!--[0--><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-2.5"><div class="min-w-0 overflow-x-auto"><div class="flex h-full flex-col gap-2.5 p-2.5 border border-white min-w-0 w-full" style="container-type: inline-size;"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 flex-wrap"><h3 class="text-sm leading-5 font-extrabold uppercase flex items-center gap-2.5 text-white">Skill Attributes</h3></div> <!--[0--><div class="overflow-x-auto min-w-0 w-full"><table class="table-auto min-w-full cursor-default text-sm leading-5"><thead><tr class="bg-gi-cryo text-section-body"><th scope="col" class="p-2.5 text-left text-sm font-semibold align-middle">Attribute</th><th scope="col" class="p-2.5 text-right text-sm font-semibold whitespace-nowrap align-middle">Value</th></tr></thead><tbody><!--[--><tr class="bg-section-body"><td class="text-left font-extrabold p-2.5 align-top min-w-44">斬撃ダメージ</td><td class="p-2.5 text-right whitespace-nowrap"><!--[0--><!--[-1--><!--[--><!--[-1--><!--[--><!--[0--><!--[-1--><!--[-1--><!--]--><!--[-1--><span class="inline-block inline-flex cursor-pointer"><!---->198.3%<!----></span><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--[0--><!---->×3<!----><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></td></tr><tr class="bg-section-header"><td class="text-left font-extrabold p-2.5 align-top min-w-44">最終斬撃ダメージ</td><td class="p-2.5 text-right whitespace-nowrap"><!--[0--><!--[-1--><!--[--><!--[-1--><!--[--><!--[0--><!--[-1--><!--[-1--><!--]--><!--[-1--><span class="inline-block inline-flex cursor-pointer"><!---->306.5%<!----></span><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></td></tr><tr class="bg-section-body"><td class="text-left font-extrabold p-2.5 align-top min-w-44">雪鳥の夢の星反応ダメージアップ</td><td class="p-2.5 text-right whitespace-nowrap"><!--[0--><!--[-1--><!--[--><!--[-1--><!--[--><!--[0--><!--[-1--><!--[-1--><!--]--><!--[-1--><span class="inline-block inline-flex cursor-pointer"><!---->50.0%<!----></span><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></td></tr><tr class="bg-section-header"><td class="text-left font-extrabold p-2.5 align-top min-w-44">雪鳥の夢の継続時間</td><td class="p-2.5 text-right whitespace-nowrap"><!--[0--><!--[-1--><!--[--><!--[-1--><!--[--><!--[0--><!--[-1--><!--[-1--><!--]--><!--[-1--><span class="inline-block inline-flex cursor-pointer"><!---->20.0<!----></span><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--[0--><!---->秒<!----><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></td></tr><tr class="bg-section-body"><td class="text-left font-extrabold p-2.5 align-top min-w-44">独舞者のシルエットの継続時間</td><td class="p-2.5 text-right whitespace-nowrap"><!--[0--><!--[-1--><!--[--><!--[-1--><!--[--><!--[0--><!--[-1--><!--[-1--><!--]--><!--[-1--><span class="inline-block inline-flex cursor-pointer"><!---->20.0<!----></span><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--[0--><!---->秒<!----><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></td></tr><tr class="bg-section-header"><td class="text-left font-extrabold p-2.5 align-top min-w-44">クールタイム</td><td class="p-2.5 text-right whitespace-nowrap"><!--[0--><!--[-1--><!--[--><!--[-1--><!--[--><!--[0--><!--[-1--><!--[-1--><!--]--><!--[-1--><span class="inline-block inline-flex cursor-pointer"><!---->15.0<!----></span><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--[0--><!---->秒<!----><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></td></tr><tr class="bg-section-body"><td class="text-left font-extrabold p-2.5 align-top min-w-44">元素エネルギー</td><td class="p-2.5 text-right whitespace-nowrap"><!--[0--><!--[-1--><!--[--><!--[-1--><!--[--><!--[0--><!--[-1--><!--[-1--><!--]--><!--[-1--><span class="inline-block inline-flex cursor-pointer"><!---->60<!----></span><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></td></tr><!--]--></tbody></table></div><!--]--></div><!----></div></div><!--]--></div> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!----><!----></div><!--]--></section><!--]--><!----></div></section><!--]--><!----> <!--[0--><section class="flex flex-col gap-2.5 scroll-m-4" id="passives"><h2 id="section_1600812576" class="w-full font-header flex flex-col gap-1  text-gi-cryo scroll-m-20 md:scroll-m-4 group cursor-pointer"><div class="w-full flex justify-between items-end select-none"><span class="uppercase relative italic font-black text-2xl leading-6 pointer-events-none flex gap-2.5 items-center"><!---->Passives<!----> <span class="inline-flex"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="not-group-hover:opacity-0 opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-100 pointer-events-none select-none"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg><!----></span> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!----></span> <!--[-1--><!--]--></div> <div class="bg-gi-cryo text-section-body h-0.75 w-full"></div></h2><!----> <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 py-2.5"><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-6"><!--[--><section class="flex flex-col gap-2.5  bg-glass bg-border scroll-m-4" id="passive-1502101"><!--[0--><div class="flex items-stretch "><!--[-1--><!--]--> <h3 class="flex px-2.5 gap-2.5 bg-section-header grow min-w-0 items-stretch min-h-12 py-1 max-w-full"><div class="flex min-w-0 basis-0 grow self-stretch gap-2.5 items-center max-sm:w-full max-w-full"><!--[0--><!--[0--><div class="relative shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center h-10 min-w-10" style="aspect-ratio: 100/100"><!----><!--[0--><!--[0--><img alt="" class="w-auto h-10 cursor-pointer hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity svelte-sapi7u" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="https://i.gachabase.net/sPw-rgUI_Ad5HaIpsfnQOOMID8oaaLl__UeTDwc6z1I/q:50/f:webp/plain/gi/assets/9ef1d26dd6bfc5074648a1e08256cc4c.png" style="aspect-ratio: 100/100; aspect-ratio: 100/100;" data-preview-group="character-passives-10000150" data-preview-src="https://cdn.gachabase.net/gi/assets/9ef1d26dd6bfc5074648a1e08256cc4c.png" data-preview-alt="Image" data-preview-download="https://cdn.gachabase.net/gi/assets/9ef1d26dd6bfc5074648a1e08256cc4c.png" data-preview-thumbnail="https://i.gachabase.net/sPw-rgUI_Ad5HaIpsfnQOOMID8oaaLl__UeTDwc6z1I/q:50/f:webp/plain/gi/assets/9ef1d26dd6bfc5074648a1e08256cc4c.png" onload="this.__e=event" onerror="this.__e=event"/> <!--[-1--><!--]--> <!--[0--><div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-1/2 z-5 gb-lazy-spinner gb-lazy-spinner-small svelte-sapi7u"></div><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!----> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!----><!----></div><!--]--><!--]--> <!--[0--><!--[0--><div class="group flex min-w-0 max-w-full items-center gap-1 self-center"><div role="button" tabindex="0" class="relative min-w-0 max-w-full text-left cursor-pointer"><!--[0--><span class="min-w-0 block"><!--[0--><!--[0--><span class="gb-wrap-text font-semibold text-sm leading-3.5 uppercase tracking-widest"><!---->選ばれし者の祝祭<!----></span><!--]--><!--]--><!----></span><!--]--> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!----></div> <button type="button" class="inline-flex shrink-0 self-center cursor-pointer border-0 bg-transparent p-0 text-current" aria-label="Copy Link" title="Copy Link"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="size-3.5 not-group-hover:opacity-0 opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-100 pointer-events-none select-none"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg><!----></button></div><!--]--><!--]--></div> <!--[-1--><!--]--></h3></div><!--]--> <!--[0--><div class="p-2.5 pt-0 flex flex-col gap-2.5"><!--[0--><span class="gb-wrap-text text-sm leading-6 min-w-0 wrap-break-word"><!--[0--><!---->オデットが<a href="#talent-11502-tooltip-11500001" data-link-token="N11500001" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity"><span style="color: #FFD780;">独舞者のシルエット</span></a>を召喚すると、さらに4層の<a href="#passive-1502101-tooltip-11500003" data-link-token="N11500003" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity"><span style="color: #FFD780;">春の華</span></a>を獲得する。<!----><!--]--></span> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!--]--><!----> <!--[0--><!--[0--><div class="scroll-m-20 md:scroll-m-4" id="passive-1502101-tooltips"><div><summary class="text-sm font-semibold cursor-pointer select-none flex gap-2.5 items-center px-1.5 py-1.5 outline-none"><!--[-1--><svg width="25" height="26" viewBox="0 0 25 26" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="text-gi-cryo size-6"><path d="M21.875 10.7354H14.8438V3.70416C14.8438 2.84137 14.144 2.14166 13.2812 2.14166H11.7188C10.856 2.14166 10.1562 2.84137 10.1562 3.70416V10.7354H3.125C2.26221 10.7354 1.5625 11.4351 1.5625 12.2979V13.8604C1.5625 14.7232 2.26221 15.4229 3.125 15.4229H10.1562V22.4542C10.1562 23.317 10.856 24.0167 11.7188 24.0167H13.2812C14.144 24.0167 14.8438 23.317 14.8438 22.4542V15.4229H21.875C22.7378 15.4229 23.4375 14.7232 23.4375 13.8604V12.2979C23.4375 11.4351 22.7378 10.7354 21.875 10.7354Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><!--]--> <span class="uppercase grow">Tooltips</span> <!--[-1--><!--]--></summary> <!--[-1--><!--]--></div><!----></div><!--]--><!--]--><!----> <!--[0--><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-2.5 gap-y-1 text-sm"><span class="uppercase font-semibold text-gi-cryo">Requirement</span> <span>Ascension 1</span></div><!--]--><!----></div><!--]--></section><section class="flex flex-col gap-2.5  bg-glass bg-border scroll-m-4" id="passive-1502201"><!--[0--><div class="flex items-stretch "><!--[-1--><!--]--> <h3 class="flex px-2.5 gap-2.5 bg-section-header grow min-w-0 items-stretch min-h-12 py-1 max-w-full"><div class="flex min-w-0 basis-0 grow self-stretch gap-2.5 items-center max-sm:w-full max-w-full"><!--[0--><!--[0--><div class="relative shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center h-10 min-w-10" style="aspect-ratio: 100/100"><!----><!--[0--><!--[0--><img alt="" class="w-auto h-10 cursor-pointer hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity svelte-sapi7u" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="https://i.gachabase.net/JloEcxj9blNzHU9Y91yjGq0lXKU6BWry555xsZcOPw0/q:50/f:webp/plain/gi/assets/d3e22203e042d5f3e08e3b304c077364.png" style="aspect-ratio: 100/100; aspect-ratio: 100/100;" data-preview-group="character-passives-10000150" data-preview-src="https://cdn.gachabase.net/gi/assets/d3e22203e042d5f3e08e3b304c077364.png" data-preview-alt="Image" data-preview-download="https://cdn.gachabase.net/gi/assets/d3e22203e042d5f3e08e3b304c077364.png" data-preview-thumbnail="https://i.gachabase.net/JloEcxj9blNzHU9Y91yjGq0lXKU6BWry555xsZcOPw0/q:50/f:webp/plain/gi/assets/d3e22203e042d5f3e08e3b304c077364.png" onload="this.__e=event" onerror="this.__e=event"/> <!--[-1--><!--]--> <!--[0--><div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-1/2 z-5 gb-lazy-spinner gb-lazy-spinner-small svelte-sapi7u"></div><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!----> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!----><!----></div><!--]--><!--]--> <!--[0--><!--[0--><div class="group flex min-w-0 max-w-full items-center gap-1 self-center"><div role="button" tabindex="0" class="relative min-w-0 max-w-full text-left cursor-pointer"><!--[0--><span class="min-w-0 block"><!--[0--><!--[0--><span class="gb-wrap-text font-semibold text-sm leading-3.5 uppercase tracking-widest"><!---->誠実なる者の悲しき歌<!----></span><!--]--><!--]--><!----></span><!--]--> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!----></div> <button type="button" class="inline-flex shrink-0 self-center cursor-pointer border-0 bg-transparent p-0 text-current" aria-label="Copy Link" title="Copy Link"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="size-3.5 not-group-hover:opacity-0 opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-100 pointer-events-none select-none"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg><!----></button></div><!--]--><!--]--></div> <!--[-1--><!--]--></h3></div><!--]--> <!--[0--><div class="p-2.5 pt-0 flex flex-col gap-2.5"><!--[0--><span class="gb-wrap-text text-sm leading-6 min-w-0 wrap-break-word"><!--[0--><!---->オデットの攻撃力のうち1000を超えた部分を基準に、攻撃力100につき、オデットの与える星反応ダメージに本来のダメージの1.5%分の追加ダメージが発生する。この方法による追加ダメージは最大で本来のダメージの30%まで。<!----><!--]--></span> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!--]--><!----> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!----> <!--[0--><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-2.5 gap-y-1 text-sm"><span class="uppercase font-semibold text-gi-cryo">Requirement</span> <span>Ascension 4</span></div><!--]--><!----></div><!--]--></section><section class="flex flex-col gap-2.5  bg-glass bg-border scroll-m-4" id="passive-1502301"><!--[0--><div class="flex items-stretch "><!--[-1--><!--]--> <h3 class="flex px-2.5 gap-2.5 bg-section-header grow min-w-0 items-stretch min-h-12 py-1 max-w-full"><div class="flex min-w-0 basis-0 grow self-stretch gap-2.5 items-center max-sm:w-full max-w-full"><!--[0--><!--[0--><div class="relative shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center h-10 min-w-10" style="aspect-ratio: 100/100"><!----><!--[0--><!--[0--><img alt="" class="w-auto h-10 cursor-pointer hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity svelte-sapi7u" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="https://i.gachabase.net/WTyhHi9ySi78NC-TSwC20Qn9ydzZKDxW5ZOjXatKcqs/q:50/f:webp/plain/gi/assets/da396fe27883de894c4a4a7ec8bba2a3.png" style="aspect-ratio: 100/100; aspect-ratio: 100/100;" data-preview-group="character-passives-10000150" data-preview-src="https://cdn.gachabase.net/gi/assets/da396fe27883de894c4a4a7ec8bba2a3.png" data-preview-alt="Image" data-preview-download="https://cdn.gachabase.net/gi/assets/da396fe27883de894c4a4a7ec8bba2a3.png" data-preview-thumbnail="https://i.gachabase.net/WTyhHi9ySi78NC-TSwC20Qn9ydzZKDxW5ZOjXatKcqs/q:50/f:webp/plain/gi/assets/da396fe27883de894c4a4a7ec8bba2a3.png" onload="this.__e=event" onerror="this.__e=event"/> <!--[-1--><!--]--> <!--[0--><div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-1/2 z-5 gb-lazy-spinner gb-lazy-spinner-small svelte-sapi7u"></div><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!----> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!----><!----></div><!--]--><!--]--> <!--[0--><!--[0--><div class="group flex min-w-0 max-w-full items-center gap-1 self-center"><div role="button" tabindex="0" class="relative min-w-0 max-w-full text-left cursor-pointer"><!--[0--><span class="min-w-0 block"><!--[0--><!--[0--><span class="gb-wrap-text font-semibold text-sm leading-3.5 uppercase tracking-widest"><!---->星光の祝福・銀暁の舞<!----></span><!--]--><!--]--><!----></span><!--]--> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!----></div> <button type="button" class="inline-flex shrink-0 self-center cursor-pointer border-0 bg-transparent p-0 text-current" aria-label="Copy Link" title="Copy Link"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="size-3.5 not-group-hover:opacity-0 opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-100 pointer-events-none select-none"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg><!----></button></div><!--]--><!--]--></div> <!--[-1--><!--]--></h3></div><!--]--> <!--[0--><div class="p-2.5 pt-0 flex flex-col gap-2.5"><!--[0--><span class="gb-wrap-text text-sm leading-6 min-w-0 wrap-break-word"><!--[0--><!----><a href="#passive-1502301-tooltip-11330003" data-link-token="N11330003" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity"><span style="color: #FFD780;">極星フィールド</span></a>内にいる時/チーム内のキャラクターが付近で星拡散反応を起こした後の8秒間、オデットはそれぞれ<span style="color: #FFD780;">輝映・星電導</span>/<span style="color: #FFD780;">輝映・星拡散</span>状態に入る。<br/>チーム内のキャラクターが超電導/氷元素拡散反応を起こすと、超電導/氷元素拡散反応は星電導/星拡散反応へと変わり、オデットの攻撃力に基づいて、チームのキャラクターが与える上記反応の基礎ダメージがアップする。攻撃力100につき、上記反応の基礎ダメージ+0.7%。この方法でアップできるダメージは最大14%まで。<!----><!--]--></span> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!--]--><!----> <!--[0--><!--[0--><div class="scroll-m-20 md:scroll-m-4" id="passive-1502301-tooltips"><div><summary class="text-sm font-semibold cursor-pointer select-none flex gap-2.5 items-center px-1.5 py-1.5 outline-none"><!--[-1--><svg width="25" height="26" viewBox="0 0 25 26" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="text-gi-cryo size-6"><path d="M21.875 10.7354H14.8438V3.70416C14.8438 2.84137 14.144 2.14166 13.2812 2.14166H11.7188C10.856 2.14166 10.1562 2.84137 10.1562 3.70416V10.7354H3.125C2.26221 10.7354 1.5625 11.4351 1.5625 12.2979V13.8604C1.5625 14.7232 2.26221 15.4229 3.125 15.4229H10.1562V22.4542C10.1562 23.317 10.856 24.0167 11.7188 24.0167H13.2812C14.144 24.0167 14.8438 23.317 14.8438 22.4542V15.4229H21.875C22.7378 15.4229 23.4375 14.7232 23.4375 13.8604V12.2979C23.4375 11.4351 22.7378 10.7354 21.875 10.7354Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><!--]--> <span class="uppercase grow">Tooltips</span> <!--[-1--><!--]--></summary> <!--[-1--><!--]--></div><!----></div><!--]--><!--]--><!----> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!----></div><!--]--></section><section class="flex flex-col gap-2.5  bg-glass bg-border scroll-m-4" id="passive-1502501"><!--[0--><div class="flex items-stretch "><!--[-1--><!--]--> <h3 class="flex px-2.5 gap-2.5 bg-section-header grow min-w-0 items-stretch min-h-12 py-1 max-w-full"><div class="flex min-w-0 basis-0 grow self-stretch gap-2.5 items-center max-sm:w-full max-w-full"><!--[0--><!--[0--><div class="relative shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center h-10 min-w-10" style="aspect-ratio: 100/100"><!----><!--[0--><!--[0--><img alt="" class="w-auto h-10 cursor-pointer hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity svelte-sapi7u" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="https://i.gachabase.net/PY-ul6ZStguo7lMVMyXb7DkCml4zfy8XiWwuZPtYLDs/q:50/f:webp/plain/gi/assets/8c597021140d7303825f3659f8ee1c75.png" style="aspect-ratio: 100/100; aspect-ratio: 100/100;" data-preview-group="character-passives-10000150" data-preview-src="https://cdn.gachabase.net/gi/assets/8c597021140d7303825f3659f8ee1c75.png" data-preview-alt="Image" data-preview-download="https://cdn.gachabase.net/gi/assets/8c597021140d7303825f3659f8ee1c75.png" data-preview-thumbnail="https://i.gachabase.net/PY-ul6ZStguo7lMVMyXb7DkCml4zfy8XiWwuZPtYLDs/q:50/f:webp/plain/gi/assets/8c597021140d7303825f3659f8ee1c75.png" onload="this.__e=event" onerror="this.__e=event"/> <!--[-1--><!--]--> <!--[0--><div 