ap-2.5 bg-section-header grow min-w-0 items-stretch min-h-12 py-1 max-w-full"><div class="flex min-w-0 basis-0 grow self-stretch gap-2.5 items-center max-sm:w-full max-w-full"><!--[-1--><!--]--> <!--[0--><!--[0--><div class="group flex min-w-0 max-w-full items-center gap-1 self-center"><div role="button" tabindex="0" class="relative min-w-0 max-w-full text-left cursor-pointer"><!--[-1--><span class="min-w-0 flex items-center self-stretch"><!--[0--><span class="gb-wrap-text "><!--[0--><!---->初めまして…<!----><!--]--></span> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!--]--><!----></span><!--]--> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!----></div> <button type="button" class="inline-flex shrink-0 self-center cursor-pointer border-0 bg-transparent p-0 text-current" aria-label="Copy Link" title="Copy Link"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="size-3.5 not-group-hover:opacity-0 opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-100 pointer-events-none select-none"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg><!----></button></div><!--]--><!--]--></div> <!--[-1--><!--]--></h3></div><!--]--> <!--[0--><div class="p-2.5 pt-0 flex flex-col gap-5"><!--[0--><span class="gb-wrap-text text-sm"><!--[0--><!---->…応援ありがとうございます。サインの横にはどんなイラストをご希望ですか？羽でいいかしら？…あら、ファンの方ではありませんでしたのね。それでは、改めて自己紹介を——私はオデット、スネージナヤコロレフスキー劇団のバレリーナです…応援、感謝いたします。<!----><!--]--></span> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!--]--><!----></div><!--]--></section><section class="flex flex-col gap-2.5  bg-glass bg-border scroll-m-4" id="voice-line-150001"><!--[0--><div class="flex items-stretch "><!--[-1--><!--]--> <h3 class="flex px-2.5 gap-2.5 bg-section-header grow min-w-0 items-stretch min-h-12 py-1 max-w-full"><div class="flex min-w-0 basis-0 grow self-stretch gap-2.5 items-center max-sm:w-full max-w-full"><!--[-1--><!--]-->